{"seq":3,"slug":"community-structure","title":"社区结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/network-science/network-properties/community-structure","wordCount":1191,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"社区结构\">社区结构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>社区结构（Community Structure）是网络中普遍存在的中观层级特征：节点自然地聚集成若干群组（社区），社区内部的连接密度远高于社区之间的连接密度。社区检测是将网络的宏观结构分解为有意义的子结构的关键技术。</p>\n<p>在软件系统中，社区结构对应着功能域、团队边界和架构模块。微服务依赖图中的社区通常对应业务域——订单域内的服务互相频繁调用，与支付域的交互则通过少数接口进行。识别这些自然社区有助于理解和优化系统架构。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  subgraph 社区 A&#10;    A1[服务 A1] --- A2[服务 A2]&#10;    A2 --- A3[服务 A3]&#10;    A1 --- A3&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph 社区 B&#10;    B1[服务 B1] --- B2[服务 B2]&#10;    B2 --- B3[服务 B3]&#10;    B1 --- B3&#10;    B3 --- B4[服务 B4]&#10;  end&#10;  A2 -.-&gt;|跨社区弱连接| B1&#10;  A3 -.-&gt;|跨社区弱连接| B2\">graph TD\n  subgraph 社区 A\n    A1[服务 A1] --- A2[服务 A2]\n    A2 --- A3[服务 A3]\n    A1 --- A3\n  end\n  subgraph 社区 B\n    B1[服务 B1] --- B2[服务 B2]\n    B2 --- B3[服务 B3]\n    B1 --- B3\n    B3 --- B4[服务 B4]\n  end\n  A2 -.-&gt;|跨社区弱连接| B1\n  A3 -.-&gt;|跨社区弱连接| B2</pre><p>社区检测算法的分类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>需要预设社区数</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Louvain</td>\n<td>模块度优化</td>\n<td>O(V·logV)</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>大规模</td>\n<td>层级化、速度快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Label Propagation</td>\n<td>标签传播</td>\n<td>O(V + E)</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>大规模</td>\n<td>最快但不稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Girvan-Newman</td>\n<td>边介数删除</td>\n<td>O(V·E²)</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>小规模</td>\n<td>精确但慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spectral</td>\n<td>拉普拉斯特征值</td>\n<td>O(V³)</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中规模</td>\n<td>理论优雅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Infomap</td>\n<td>信息流压缩</td>\n<td>O(E)</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>大规模</td>\n<td>基于信息论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Leiden</td>\n<td>改进 Louvain</td>\n<td>O(V·logV)</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>大规模</td>\n<td>保证连通社区</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"模块度与-louvain-算法\">模块度与 Louvain 算法</h2><p>模块度（Modularity, Q）是评估社区划分质量的标准指标。Q 度量了社区内部的实际边数与随机网络中期望边数之间的差值。Q 值范围为 [-0.5, 1]，通常 Q &gt; 0.3 表示有显著的社区结构。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const calculateModularity = (graph: Map&lt;string, Set&lt;string&gt;&gt;, communities: Map&lt;string, number&gt;): number =&gt; {&#10;  let m = 0;&#10;  for (const neighbors of graph.values()) m += neighbors.size;&#10;  m /= 2;&#10;&#10;  let q = 0;&#10;  for (const [node, comm] of communities) {&#10;    const ki = graph.get(node)?.size ?? 0;&#10;    for (const neighbor of graph.get(node) ?? []) {&#10;      if (communities.get(neighbor) === comm) {&#10;        const kj = graph.get(neighbor)?.size ?? 0;&#10;        q += 1 - (ki * kj) / (2 * m);&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  return q / (2 * m);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateModularity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">graph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>>, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">communities</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> neighbors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> neighbors.size;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">comm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> communities) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ki</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node)?.size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> neighbor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (communities.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(neighbor) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> comm) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> kj</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(neighbor)?.size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        q </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ki </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kj) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Louvain 算法通过两阶段迭代优化模块度。第一阶段：每个节点尝试加入使模块度增益最大的邻居社区。第二阶段：将每个社区折叠为一个超级节点，构建新的压缩图。重复这两个阶段直到模块度不再增加。</p>\n<p>Louvain 算法的层级化结果天然提供了多粒度的社区视图。在微服务架构中，第一级社区可能对应子模块，第二级社区对应业务域，第三级社区对应产品线。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>微服务映射</th>\n<th>治理动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Level 0</td>\n<td>单个节点</td>\n<td>单个微服务</td>\n<td>服务级监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Level 1</td>\n<td>小社区</td>\n<td>子模块（3-5 服务）</td>\n<td>子模块 Owner</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Level 2</td>\n<td>中社区</td>\n<td>业务域（10-20 服务）</td>\n<td>域级 SLA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Level 3</td>\n<td>大社区</td>\n<td>产品线</td>\n<td>架构评审</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"社区检测在架构分析中的应用\">社区检测在架构分析中的应用</h2><p>将社区检测应用于微服务依赖图，可以回答几个关键的架构治理问题。</p>\n<p><strong>验证微服务边界是否合理</strong>。如果算法检测出的社区与团队实际划分的服务域高度吻合，说明微服务边界与实际的通信模式一致。如果大量跨域调用出现在社区内部，可能意味着当前的服务域划分不够合理，需要重新考虑服务的归属。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CommunityAnalysis {&#10;  communities: Map&lt;string, number&gt;;&#10;  teamAssignments: Map&lt;string, string&gt;;&#10;  crossCommunityEdges: number;&#10;  totalEdges: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const analyzeAlignmentWithTeams = (&#10;  communities: Map&lt;string, number&gt;,&#10;  teamAssignments: Map&lt;string, string&gt;,&#10;): { alignment: number; misaligned: Array&lt;{ service: string; community: number; team: string }&gt; } =&gt; {&#10;  const communityTeamMap = new Map&lt;number, Map&lt;string, number&gt;&gt;();&#10;&#10;  for (const [service, community] of communities) {&#10;    const team = teamAssignments.get(service) ?? &#39;unknown&#39;;&#10;    if (!communityTeamMap.has(community)) {&#10;      communityTeamMap.set(community, new Map());&#10;    }&#10;    const teamCounts = communityTeamMap.get(community)!;&#10;    teamCounts.set(team, (teamCounts.get(team) ?? 0) + 1);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const misaligned: Array&lt;{ service: string; community: number; team: string }&gt; = [];&#10;  let aligned = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (const [community, teamCounts] of communityTeamMap) {&#10;    const dominantTeam = [...teamCounts.entries()].sort((a, b) =&gt; b[1] - a[1])[0][0];&#10;&#10;    for (const [service, comm] of communities) {&#10;      if (comm !== community) continue;&#10;      const team = teamAssignments.get(service) ?? &#39;unknown&#39;;&#10;      if (team === dominantTeam) {&#10;        aligned++;&#10;      } else {&#10;        misaligned.push({ service, community, team });&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    alignment: aligned / communities.size,&#10;    misaligned,&#10;  };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CommunityAnalysis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  communities</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292